      "title": "Create a PR-head graph overlay",
      "summary": "Builds an in-memory graph view for the changed files: their base symbols are replaced with parsed head symbols, while unchanged base symbols are retained. Deleted files are not parsed, and the base snapshot is left untouched."
    },
